# The launcher shim is generated with CRLF line endings (a Windows `wscript`
# artefact) and `tests/deploy.test.js` asserts the checked-in file byte-for-byte
# against the generator. Normalising to LF in the index and checking it out as CRLF
# keeps the diff clean without changing what Windows sees.
packaging/*.vbs text eol=crlf
